        <p>重试机制与幂等</p>
        <p>消息持久化保障</p>
  - elementId: sum-conclusion-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 370, 1160, 260]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: sum-conclusion-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [90, 395, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:star"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: sum-conclusion-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [132, 393, 300, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      color: "$light"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>项目总结</strong></p>
  - elementId: sum-conclusion-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 445, 1100, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$lightText"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.7
      text: |
        <p>beacon-cloud 是一个<strong style="color:$accent;">功能完整的分布式短信平台</strong>，架构设计合理：</p>
        <p>• <strong>微服务拆分清晰</strong> — 按职责拆分为 9 个业务模块 + 1 个公共模块，高内聚低耦合</p>
        <p>• <strong>异步解耦</strong> — 核心链路通过 RabbitMQ 串联，各模块可独立扩缩容</p>
        <p>• <strong>动态配置</strong> — Nacos + @RefreshScope 实现校验链顺序等配置热更新</p>
        <p>• <strong>协议层自研</strong> — Netty 自实现 CMPP 编解码，具备运营商级短信下发能力</p>
  - elementId: sum-page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1190, 690, 50, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 12
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>14 / 15</p>
